    "title": "ESP32-DevKitC V4 User Guide, section Header Block (tables J2 and J3)",
    "url": "https://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-dev-kits/en/latest/esp32/esp32-devkitc/user_guide.html",
    "revision": "board ESP32-DevKitC V4 (page 'latest' as retrieved; photo shows ESP32-WROOM-32E)",
    "retrieved": "2026-10-23",
    "pinNumbering": "J2-n and J3-n are the header and the 'No.' column of the user guide's J2 and J3 tables.",
    "notes": "GND is on J2-14, J3-1 and J3-7 (one ground on the board, so group GND). D0-D3, CLK and CMD (GPIO6-11) connect to the SPI flash; the guide says to avoid them. Roles: P -> 3V3 power_out (on-board regulator output) and 5V power_in (board supply input); I -> input; I/O -> bidir; G -> ground. No interface roles: any GPIO can carry I2C or SPI through the GPIO matrix, so the board documentation assigns none."
  },
